Suppose that towers (5,2,3) are invoked

1. during the first recursive call, spare is calculated as 6-2-3 = 1, therefore the first recursive call is (4,2,1)
2. 5 calls will be made
3. Move #1: From Tower 2 to Tower 3
4. towers (3,2,3)

Suppose that towers (8,1,2) is invoked. How many lines will be printed to stdout?
Answer: 255 lines will be printed

